=== SURVEY ===
Inspected required frontend instructions: react-frontend and unit-conversion.
Reviewed all listed target files plus optional web\src\api\client.ts and web\src\api\hooks\useTelemetry.ts because central URL/text/live-signal helpers were needed.
Found runtime fetches in devtools, polling, settings, useWatch, useVehicleLive, and ApiPlayground OpenAPI discovery; found old relative API imports in listed component/hooks files.
Initial worktree was clean before edits.
=== REASONING ===
Direct JSON API calls should route through request<T>() with prefixless paths so /api/v1 prefixing, auth behavior, retries, and errors remain centralized.
OpenAPI discovery returns YAML text, so client.ts needed a text response mode behind request() instead of leaving a page-local fetch.
Watch API calls require X-API-Key and no auth-refresh retry, so client.ts needed a skipAuthRefresh path that still centralizes URL prefixing.
Download and playground execution URLs are browser-owned flows, so client.ts now exposes apiUrl(path) to avoid duplicating API prefix construction in callers.
useVehicleLive bootstrap belongs behind the telemetry API hook layer; it now consumes useVehicleLiveSignals() instead of fetching directly.
=== CHANGES ===
web\src\api\client.ts: added apiUrl(), request text response mode, and skipAuthRefresh direct request support.
web\src\api\devtools.ts: migrated system/admin fetch helpers to request() and centralized download URL building through apiUrl().
web\src\api\polling.ts: migrated polling endpoints to request() using prefixless paths.
web\src\api\settings.ts: migrated map config to request().
web\src\api\hooks\useWatch.ts: migrated watch request helper to request() with API-key headers and skipAuthRefresh.
web\src\api\hooks\useTelemetry.ts: added live signals helper and hook for /signals/{vehicleId}/live.
web\src\hooks\useVehicleLive.ts: replaced direct bootstrap fetch with useVehicleLiveSignals().
web\src\features\admin\pages\ApiPlaygroundPage.tsx: migrated OpenAPI discovery to request() text mode and centralized API URLs; retained one intentional user-entered execution fetch.
web\src\components\SignalQueryControls.tsx, web\src\components\data-display\PollingEngine.tsx, web\src\hooks\useAutomationEvents.ts: replaced relative API imports with aliases.
